quiz-AB.pdf
  "Patente AB" (conseguimento): the official list of quiz questions for driving licences A and B.
  Source: Ministero delle Infrastrutture e dei Trasporti, published on the Portale
  dell'Automobilista:
  https://www.ilportaledellautomobilista.it/web/portale-automobilista/-/quiz-per-le-patenti-am-b-superiori-e-cqc
  Original file name: 210926_Conseguimento A-B italiano.pdf
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Italy (CC BY 3.0 IT), as stated in the ministry's
  legal notes (https://www.mit.gov.it/note-legali).
  Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/it/legalcode

quiz.json and figures/
  Adapted from quiz-AB.pdf by scripts/extract_quiz.py. The question texts, answers, quesito and
  chapter structure and the images are extracted from the PDF. Changes made: the content was
  restructured as JSON, broken apostrophes and line breaks were fixed, identical images were
  stored once, and short chapter names and starting difficulty levels (assigned with AI) were
  added. These adapted files are distributed under the same CC BY 3.0 IT license.

Patente Pronta is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Ministero delle Infrastrutture e dei
Trasporti or the Motorizzazione Civile.
